    "created_at": "2023-06-16T08:16:30Z",
    "updated_at": "2023-06-16T08:16:30Z",
    "body": "> No, Bucket here refers to Storage Standard terminology. Not the Storage Buckets APIs.\r\n\r\nThank you! I see, as per this [definition](https://storage.spec.whatwg.org/#storage-bucket), which the Storage Buckets API also [references](https://wicg.github.io/storage-buckets/#storage-bucket-getdirectory:~:text=Let%20bucket%20be%20a%20new%20storage%20bucket%20with%20name%20name.). It's just a bit confusing that there's also a [`StorageBucket`](https://wicg.github.io/storage-buckets/#storagebucket). ",
